<title>FRANCE: Detroyat adds Lafarge to favoured stocks.</title>
<headline>Detroyat adds Lafarge to favoured stocks.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Research firm Detroyat has replaced Lagardere with Lafarge on its favoured stock list, portfolio managers said.</p>
<p>Lafarge shares were up 1.46 percent at 319.60 at 1040 GMT, and Lagardere shares were 1.28 percent lower at 154.20. The bourse's CAC-40 index was down 0.17 percent at the same time.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
